{"data":{"body":"**P1:** Persisted-link recovery runs only when this method is called. If the child state is stored as terminal and the runner exits before this hook updates the parent, a fresh executor never scans terminal linked children, so the parent invoke remains STARTED forever. Reconcile terminal children during startup\u2014or persist a completion outbox\u2014and test restarting with an already-terminal child without manually invoking this private method.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7wg2tB","finding_digest":"37e024583fa24dc83171a92690d19d6ec04a473f6ff95d054e9e080bd309dfa8","finding_id":"arf_v1_g7qciwb7ujg4qmlrvetjbum5n3","finding_key":"testing/executor.py::_notify_parent_of_terminal_child::persistent-link-recovery","identity_key":"testing/executor.py::_notify_parent_of_terminal_child::persistent-link-recovery","line":1845,"observation_digest":"fc5b36d63389a7856c8a1a8e2233e77e2323f1de3671c4855a1dd492d7baaf72","observation_id":"aro_v1_7rntnvrtrgtyk3ekdkhcem7hpy","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/executor.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_g7qciwb7ujg4qmlrvetjbum5n3","published_at":"2026-09-17T09:20:36Z","review_id":"arr_v1_6fgbuaf6kfgym33jkdawdtz66x","reviewed_base_sha":"cf4d27f59c2bf14f87c3ef75f58fc0881b2e2c34","reviewed_head_sha":"016ccb33c00e7b8840da85de747444f9ec131aec","reviewer":"codex","start_line":1845,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":731},"record_id":"art_v1_rurtw2fk4pcyxziht67fbaq5ar","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-17T09:20:36Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
